---
// Cloudflare, 2 July 2019. Numbers are only the ones quoted in the hook:
// CPU "nearly 100%", down "for 27 minutes", "lost 80% of our traffic".
const W = 900, H = 400;
const waiting = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5];
---
<figure class="bep6g">
  <div class="bep6g-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="One processor lane. A single large red block, a WAF rule with a regular expression that never finishes, fills the lane while six small HTTP requests wait behind it. Below, a timeline: the service was down for 27 minutes, CPU nearly 100 percent across the network, 80 percent of traffic lost.">
    <text x="40" y="38" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>one processor, one job that will not step aside</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một bộ xử lý, một việc không chịu nhường chỗ</tspan></text>

    <rect x="40" y="66" width="520" height="56" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x="300" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>WAF rule: regex backtracks enormously</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>luật WAF: regex backtrack khủng khiếp</tspan></text>
    <text x="300" y="109" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>CPU nearly 100% across the network</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>CPU gần 100% trên toàn mạng</tspan></text>

    {waiting.map((i) => <rect x={600 + i * 44} y="80" width="34" height="28" rx="4" class="box" />)}
    <text x="600" y="140" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>HTTP/HTTPS requests wait behind it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request HTTP/HTTPS đứng chờ phía sau nó</tspan></text>

    <line x1="40" y1="190" x2="860" y2="190" class="grid" />

    <text x="40" y="232" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>what the outage looked like</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sự cố nhìn từ ngoài</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="260" width="820" height="34" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x="450" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>Cloudflare service down for 27 minutes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dịch vụ Cloudflare sập 27 phút</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="324" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>2 July 2019: rules update pushed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2/7/2019: đẩy bản cập nhật luật</tspan></text>

    <text x="860" y="324" text-anchor="end" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>"we had lost 80% of our traffic"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>"chúng tôi đã mất 80% lưu lượng"</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="372" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Nothing crashed. Every server was busy, doing exactly what it was told.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không gì crash. Mọi server đều bận, làm đúng thứ được giao.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One job that holds the processor starves everything that shares it. Quotes are Cloudflare's own account of the incident.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một việc giữ chặt bộ xử lý sẽ bỏ đói mọi thứ dùng chung nó. Các trích dẫn là lời kể của chính Cloudflare về sự cố.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep6g { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep6g-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep6g svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep6g text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep6g .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep6g .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep6g .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep6g .v { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6g .vr { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6g .tk { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep6g .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep6g .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .bep6g .ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6g .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6g .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6g .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep6g .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep6g .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep6g .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep6g figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
